step 6 right shift a = b = +R: c = e^{-2R} c_1 =: c_+ : OK  (this is the hinge input)
step 7 functional-equation symmetry c(A,B) = e^{-(A+B)} c(-B,-A): OK
step 8 P = x, R -> 0: c -> 1 + 1/theta (Wu / Lamzouri LemmaWu l.1004): OK
